WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
Level 42 · Diamond Night · Hard difficulty
Native Mac gameplay with automatic controls.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.500
An energizer turns the ghosts blue.
A portal carries you to the other side.

00:10.500 --> 00:13.800
Shield activated: protection from one ghost hit.

00:14.500 --> 00:17.000
Time Slow gives you extra room to maneuver.

00:17.200 --> 00:20.000
Grab another energizer—and eat a ghost.

00:20.500 --> 00:24.000
Magnet activated: collect nearby dots.
Stations refill your special powers.

00:27.500 --> 00:31.000
Collect energizers to turn the chase around.
Magnet collects dots across nearby corridors.

00:31.900 --> 00:34.500
Use a portal to cross the maze.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.000
Power on: chase down and eat two more ghosts.

00:41.000 --> 00:46.000
60 selectable levels · Four difficulties
Keyboard or mouse · Exact save and resume
